---
alwaysApply: true
---

Before `git commit`, review the staged diff. In the reply, report bugs, KISS violations, file splits, and edge cases.

- Read `git diff --cached`.
- No extra types, parameters, or files for a need this change does not have. Split a file only when it has two unrelated reasons to change. Do not split to satisfy a line count. `too_many_lines` stays allowed.
- Core behavior changes extend `crates/core/src/tests.rs`.
- Run `cargo fmt --all`, then `cargo clippy --workspace --all-targets -- -D warnings`, and fix what they report.
- Stage fixes, run `powershell -NoProfile -File .cursor/hooks/mark-reviewed.ps1`, then commit. Do not use `--no-verify`.
- The pre-commit hook runs `cargo fmt --all -- --check`, `cargo clippy --workspace --all-targets -- -D warnings`, and `cargo test --workspace`.
